abstract: "Research software and computational documentation for retrospective annual land surface temperature modeling in the Barranquilla Metropolitan Area, Colombia. The repository integrates Landsat 8/9 spectral trajectories, NASA POWER regional climate-radiative descriptors, and U-Net, ConvLSTM, and squeeze-and-excitation architectures under a temporally controlled training, validation, and test design."

